1
00:00:00,848 --> 00:00:02,818
(cooing)

2
00:00:04,819 --> 00:00:06,349
(Howard:)Okay, here's the plan.

3
00:00:06,354 --> 00:00:08,624
(Howard:)I'm gonna put the food
in the bag,

4
00:00:08,623 --> 00:00:11,823
(Howard:)and when he lands in the bag
to eat it, we close it up.

5
00:00:11,826 --> 00:00:13,996
(Leonard:)A Slim Jim?

6
00:00:16,063 --> 00:00:16,713
(Howard:)It's all I could find.
It'll work.

7
00:00:16,713 --> 00:00:17,363
(Dr Koothrappali:)Sure.

8
00:00:17,365 --> 00:00:18,765
(Leonard:)If the pigeon's stoned
or a trucker.

9
00:00:21,502 --> 00:00:23,072
(Howard:)Okay, well, what's your plan?

10
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:24,170
(Leonard:)I told you my plan.

11
00:00:24,172 --> 00:00:25,942
(Leonard:)Let's call Building Services
and get help.

12
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:29,380
(Howard:)And admit that we contaminated
the clean room?

13
00:00:29,377 --> 00:00:31,777
No, admit that you
contaminated the clean room.

14
00:00:31,779 --> 00:00:34,049
(Howard:)Why do you keep assuming
it was me?

15
00:00:34,048 --> 00:00:36,418
(Leonard:)Because you do this kind
of thing all the time,

16
00:00:36,417 --> 00:00:38,217
(Leonard:)and then you try
to cover it up.

17
00:00:38,219 --> 00:00:40,289
(Howard:)Like when?
(scoffs)

18
00:00:40,288 --> 00:00:42,258
(Leonard:)What about when you
flipped the Mars Rover,

19
00:00:42,256 --> 00:00:44,186
(Leonard:)or lost Koothrappali's dog,

20
00:00:44,192 --> 00:00:46,592
(Leonard:)or almost drove off
with that baby?

21
00:00:46,594 --> 00:00:50,434
(Howard:)Again, it looked like my car,
and the baby didn't even cry

22
00:00:50,431 --> 00:00:52,561
(Howard:)until his mother punched me
with her keys.

23
00:00:52,567 --> 00:00:55,367
(Leonard:)Fine, put the Slim Jim
in the garbage bag.

24
00:00:55,369 --> 00:00:57,369
(Howard:)Well, what if you said it

